# Welcome to Sweettooth chapter III: "X is one plus the number of Foods you control" counts every Food (CR 111.10b), whatever else
# it is: Tough Cookie is an Artifact Creature - Food Golem, so it counts beside its own Food token and the one chapter II made.
# Turn 1: the Saga (chapter I: a Human token). Turn 3: chapter II's Food, then the Cookie and the Food token it makes. Turn 5:
# chapter III with three Foods: X = 4, so the 1/1 Human (the Cookie, also a creature, is another target Bot1 doesn't pick) becomes 5/5.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Welcome to Sweettooth
Tough Cookie
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Welcome to Sweettooth.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Tough Cookie.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Food Token#1.Types = Artifact
? Bot1.Battlefield.Food Token#2.Types = Artifact
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Human Token)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Human Token.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 4
? Bot1.Battlefield.Human Token.Power = 5

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Human Token.Toughness = 5
Bot1.Graveyard = Welcome to Sweettooth
